<div class="elections-page container py-5">
    <div class="quote-section bg-primary text-white text-center py-4 mb-5 rounded shadow">
        <h2 class="mb-3">"Your vote is your voice. Make it count!"</h2>
        <p class="mb-0">Participate in the elections to strengthen democracy and shape the future of Pakistan.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="secure-voting bg-light p-4 rounded shadow-sm mb-5">
        <h3 class="text-center text-dark mb-4">Why Your Vote is Secure</h3>
        <p class="text-center">
            The Election Commission of Pakistan ensures the utmost transparency and security in the voting process.
            From data encryption to real-time monitoring, your vote is protected against any tampering or fraud.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="voting-status bg-light p-4 rounded shadow-sm mb-5">
        <h3 class="text-center text-dark mb-4">Cast Your Vote</h3>
        <div class="text-center">
            <p class="mb-2"><strong>Status:</strong> Voting Not Started</p>
            <a href="https://localhost:7267/CastVote/castVote" class="btn btn-success me-2">Start Voting</a>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="upcoming-elections bg-light p-4 rounded shadow-sm">
